{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720940/extras/bca4a0e03b0ccb0b068bc54aa33c393b.avif?t=1771949790\" width=625 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Book Smugglers</strong> is a narrative point and click adventure based on a true, untold story. Set in 19th-century, you play as a member of the underground network of &quot;<i>knygne\u0161iai&quot;</i>\u00a0\u2014 book smugglers risking their lives to preserve a forbidden language under Tsarist rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720940/extras/d41a9472b3cd3bb272fb0fc3f18d4959.avif?t=1771949790\" width=625 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission requires careful planning. Strategically manage your limited supplies, such as food, money, books and other tools. What you carry will determine how you will be able to act. Choose wisely. You won\u2019t be able to bring everything.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720940/extras/0026eae2d07aa2e84fd3bed6b5f36fe8.poster.avif?t=1771949790\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720940/extras/0026eae2d07aa2e84fd3bed6b5f36fe8.webm?t=1771949790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720940/extras/0026eae2d07aa2e84fd3bed6b5f36fe8.mp4?t=1771949790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720940/extras/34e99ec88dafb04846511aa601fb27cc.avif?t=1771949790\" width=625 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the weight of your decisions, because even choosing the same option may bring very different results that can heavily influence your mission. Sometimes you will succeed. Sometimes you will fail. And sometimes, things will take an unexpected turn.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720940/extras/8d01ea2a2212d270c41921cc03841da6.poster.avif?t=1771949790\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720940/extras/8d01ea2a2212d270c41921cc03841da6.webm?t=1771949790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720940/extras/8d01ea2a2212d270c41921cc03841da6.mp4?t=1771949790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720940/extras/3e2fbb5310e7116ddf619ab53ce130ba.avif?t=1771949790\" width=625 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Interact with real figures from history, decode secret messages, and uncover stories hidden by censorship. The narrative is inspired by a resistance so unique, UNESCO recognizes it as world heritage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720940/extras/3382ce5fde1fa6076181baca4a73b348.poster.avif?t=1771949790\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720940/extras/3382ce5fde1fa6076181baca4a73b348.webm?t=1771949790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720940/extras/3382ce5fde1fa6076181baca4a73b348.mp4?t=1771949790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Berry Prepared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2720940/d6de57684f1debcc7a69dcaed957a1ed1b63d598.jpg"},{"name":"Codebreaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2720940/e61666d1cae9704fd82d1d6e850a4a2d6734478f.jpg"},{"name":"Dawn Bringer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2720940/f0b85a41520839eb03ff26cc3736230dd4f0d33d.jpg"},{"name":"God's Plan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2720940/04a0c5ca589ac8470863f8b7c6e311e46feaf9e3.jpg"},{"name":"Healthy Smuggler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2720940/6f6e2e8d71d31fb6e685cbcee7a0f0723d0215ae.jpg"},{"name":"Legacy of Bielinis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2720940/9454f26fda3bd274d5fa4aa14020165e343db8a9.jpg"},{"name":"Finders Keepers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2720940/2d9c88733e7050cedc39ff6139cdc81a2bb4dc04.jpg"},{"name":"Living Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2720940/8a9df6089623f592eea9ccc06e39b97e83931fc5.jpg"},{"name":"Man of the People","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2720940/8b71952c4b50c1452a736f42bccfa436e058decf.jpg"},{"name":"Marked and Forgotten","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2720940/58cb815e808347e9abd1ce57567c9f30a817f9ff.jpg"}],"total":27},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2720940?t=17719